### ===================================================================
### UBL Lost and Found — REST API Interactive Client
### Gunakan ekstensi "REST Client" (Huachao Mao) atau "Thunder Client" di VS Code.
### Cukup klik "Send Request" di atas tiap endpoint di bawah ini.
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# Masukkan kata sandi petugas pos di bawah ini untuk pengujian lokal:
@officerPassword = kataSandiPetugasAnda

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECK & STATUS SERVER
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1.1 LOGIN PETUGAS (OFFICER AUTHENTICATION - BCRYPT VERIFIED)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name officerLoginSuccess
# Login Petugas Pos Pengajaran (Ganti {{officerPassword}} dengan kata sandi petugas Anda)
POST {{api}}/auth/officer-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lostandfound.budiluhur@gmail.com",
  "password": "{{officerPassword}}"
}

###

# @name officerLoginInvalidPassword
# Simulasi 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS jika kata sandi salah
POST {{api}}/auth/officer-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "lostandfound.budiluhur@gmail.com",
  "password": "sandiSalahTesting123"
}

###

# @name officerLoginInvalidFormat
# Simulasi 400 VALIDATION_ERROR jika format email tidak valid
POST {{api}}/auth/officer-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bukan-email",
  "password": "apapunsandinya"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. KATALOG PUBLIK (PUBLIC CATALOG - GET ALL & FILTER)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name getCatalogPage1
# Mengambil katalog publik halaman 1 (limit 8 barang sesuai ketentuan UI)
GET {{api}}/items?page=1&limit=8
Accept: application/json

###

# @name getCatalogPage2
# Mengambil katalog publik halaman 2 (sisa 4 barang)
GET {{api}}/items?page=2&limit=8
Accept: application/json

###

# @name filterByCategory
# Filter barang temuan berdasarkan kategori (e.g. Elektronik, Aksesori, Kunci, Dompet)
GET {{api}}/items?category=Elektronik
Accept: application/json

###

# @name searchKeyword
# Pencarian kata kunci barang (e.g. Honda, Asus, Dompet)
GET {{api}}/items?query=Vario
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. DETAIL BARANG PUBLIK (GET BY ID)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name getItemDetailValid
# Ganti dengan UUID item yang ada (contoh: Kunci Motor Honda Vario)
GET {{api}}/items/6daac34e-6258-45e7-88ed-175b4097cc00
Accept: application/json

###

# @name getItemDetailNotFound
# Simulasi error 404 ketika barang tidak ditemukan atau belum STORED
GET {{api}}/items/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. POS OPERASIONAL KAMPUS (SERVICE POSTS)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name getServicePosts
# Mengambil daftar pos penyimpanan operasional (Pos Pengajaran, dll)
GET {{api}}/posts
Accept: application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. CLOUDFLARE R2 OBJECT STREAMING (STREAM GAMBAR)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name streamKunciMotor
# Stream langsung dari Cloudflare R2 bucket dengan fallback lokal
GET {{baseUrl}}/storage/items/kunci-motor.png

###

# @name streamAirPods
GET {{baseUrl}}/storage/items/airpods-pro.png

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. PENCATATAN BARANG PETUGAS (POST /officer/items)
### Catatan: Memerlukan header autentikasi Petugas atau simulasi test
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name createItemUnauthorized
# Simulasi penolakan 401 jika dipanggil tanpa sesi otorisasi petugas
POST {{api}}/officer/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_name": "Helm KYT Merah",
  "category": "Aksesori",
  "found_location": "Parkiran Barat Gedung Unit 7",
  "found_on": "2026-10-27",
  "public_description": "Helm half-face warna merah glossy",
  "private_verification_notes": "Ada stiker nama di bagian belakang",
  "item_photo_upload_tokens": ["mock-token-sample"]
}

###

# @name createItemAuthorized
# Pencatatan barang dengan token autentikasi petugas dari request officerLoginSuccess
POST {{api}}/officer/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{officerLoginSuccess.response.body.data.token}}

{
  "item_name": "Helm KYT Merah",
  "category": "Aksesori",
  "found_location": "Parkiran Barat Gedung Unit 7",
  "found_on": "2026-10-27",
  "public_description": "Helm half-face warna merah glossy",
  "private_verification_notes": "Ada stiker nama di bagian belakang",
  "item_photo_upload_tokens": ["mock-token-sample"]
}

